    "On day 1 you recorded 30 seconds for the person you'd be on day 75. Nobody hears it before. Not even you.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Au jour 1 tu as enregistré 30 secondes pour la personne que tu serais au jour 75. Personne ne l'entend avant. Même pas toi."
