    "75 days.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "75 jours."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Goals set. Debrief done. Nothing slipped. One more vote for who you're becoming.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Objectifs fixés. Bilan fait. Rien n'a dérapé. Un vote de plus pour qui tu deviens."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The hardest 15 days are behind you. Tomorrow you start replacing, not just blocking.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Les 15 jours les plus durs sont derrière toi. Demain tu commences à remplacer, pas seulement bloquer."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "You have new habits now. Next: who you are when nobody's watching.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Tu as de nouvelles habitudes. Ensuite : qui tu es quand personne ne regarde."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "You know who you are. Next act reopens the door, 15 minutes a day. Hold it.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Tu sais qui tu es. L'acte suivant rouvre la porte, 15 minutes par jour. Tiens-la."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "You held the window. Last act: the scaffolding comes off.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Tu as tenu la fenêtre. Dernier acte : l'échafaudage tombe."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "You're out.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Tu es sorti."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "You didn't quit TikTok. You became someone who doesn't need it. The vault is open.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Tu n'as pas arrêté TikTok. Tu es devenu quelqu'un qui n'en a pas besoin. Le coffre est ouvert."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "You spend": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Tu passes"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "I want them back": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Je veux les récupérer"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "75 days. Your voice. Your life.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "75 jours. Ta voix. Ta vie."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "What if your own voice called you to stop?": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Et si ta propre voix t'appelait pour t'arrêter ?"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Stick clones your voice. It calls you in the morning for your goals, the second you open TikTok, and at night for the debrief. You can ignore anyone. Not yourself.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Stick clone ta voix. Elle t'appelle le matin pour tes objectifs, à la seconde où tu ouvres TikTok, et le soir pour le bilan. Tu peux ignorer n'importe qui. Pas toi-même."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "7:00 · Wake-up call": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "7:00 · Appel du réveil"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "\"Up. Give me three goals. Real ones.\"": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "« Debout. Donne-moi trois objectifs. Des vrais. »"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "14:12 · You open TikTok": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "14:12 · Tu ouvres TikTok"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "\"You promised me this morning. Close it. Yes or no?\"": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "« Tu m'as promis ce matin. Ferme. Oui ou non ? »"
