          }
        }
      }
    },
    "How many hours a day?": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Combien d'heures par jour ?"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Be honest. Check Screen Time if you're not sure. Most people underestimate by half.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Sois honnête. Regarde Temps d'écran si tu doutes. La plupart des gens sous-estiment de moitié."
