        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Prénom"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Why your voice?": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Pourquoi ta voix ?"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "You can hang up on a coach. You can't hang up on yourself. Stick clones your voice so every call is you, talking to you.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Tu peux raccrocher au nez d'un coach. Pas au tien. Stick clone ta voix pour que chaque appel soit toi, qui te parles."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Delete the clone any time from Me › My voice.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Supprime le clone à tout moment depuis Moi › Ma voix."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Record my voice": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Enregistrer ma voix"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Read this. Naturally.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Lis ça. Naturellement."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Read this out loud.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Lis ça à voix haute."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "About 60 seconds. Speak like you'd talk to a friend. Quiet room, phone at normal distance.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Environ 60 secondes. Parle comme à un ami. Pièce calme, téléphone à distance normale."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Keep going · %lld s more": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Continue · encore %lld s"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Microphone access is off. Enable it in Settings › Stick to record.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "L'accès au micro est désactivé. Active-le dans Réglages › Stick pour enregistrer."
