    "Building your voice…": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Création de ta voix…"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Ready.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Prête."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "That didn't work.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ça n'a pas marché."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "About 20 seconds. Don't close the app.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Environ 20 secondes. Ne ferme pas l'app."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Continue with a system voice for now": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Continuer avec une voix système pour l'instant"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Your phone is about to ring.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ton téléphone va sonner."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "That was you.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "C'était toi."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "It's your voice. Pick up. Listen to what you're about to promise yourself.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "C'est ta voix. Décroche. Écoute ce que tu vas te promettre."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "From now on, that's who calls. Every morning, every night, and the second you open TikTok.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Désormais, c'est cette voix qui appelle. Chaque matin, chaque soir, et à la seconde où tu ouvres TikTok."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Sign it.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Signe."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The contract": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Le contrat"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "I, %@, commit to 75 days.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Moi, %@, je m'engage pour 75 jours."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "I pick up when my voice calls.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Je décroche quand ma voix appelle."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "I set real goals every morning and report every night.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Je fixe de vrais objectifs chaque matin et je rends des comptes chaque soir."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "I never miss twice.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Je ne rate jamais deux fois."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "I am becoming: %@": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Je deviens : %@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Sign with your finger": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Signe avec ton doigt"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Signature area": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Zone de signature"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Draw your signature with one finger": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Dessine ta signature avec un doigt"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "I commit to 75 days": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Je m'engage pour 75 jours"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Block the apps for real.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Bloque les apps pour de vrai."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Stick uses Apple's Screen Time to shield the apps you picked. When one opens, you get the shield and your voice calls.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Stick utilise Temps d'écran d'Apple pour protéger les apps choisies. Quand l'une s'ouvre, tu vois le bouclier et ta voix appelle."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Apple asks for Screen Time access. Stick only uses it to block and to count time on your chosen apps.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Apple demande l'accès à Temps d'écran. Stick ne s'en sert que pour bloquer et compter le temps sur tes apps choisies."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Stick never sees which apps you use or what you do in them. Apple keeps that on your phone.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Stick ne voit jamais quelles apps tu utilises ni ce que tu y fais. Apple garde ça sur ton téléphone."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Screen Time isn't available on this device yet.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Temps d'écran n'est pas encore disponible sur cet appareil."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "No problem: the Shortcuts automation makes your voice call the instant TikTok opens. You'll set it up in one minute at the end.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Pas grave : l'automatisation Raccourcis fait appeler ta voix dès que TikTok s'ouvre. Tu la configures en une minute à la fin."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Apps selected · change": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Apps sélectionnées · modifier"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Choose the apps to block": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Choisir les apps à bloquer"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Allow Screen Time": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Autoriser Temps d'écran"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Let your voice ring.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Laisse ta voix sonner."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The wake-up call and the debrief use iOS alarms: they ring on the Lock Screen, on your Watch, and through Silent mode.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "L'appel du réveil et le bilan utilisent les alarmes iOS : elles sonnent sur l'écran verrouillé, sur ta Watch, et percent le mode Silencieux."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "So your voice can wake you up and ring at debrief time.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Pour que ta voix te réveille et sonne à l'heure du bilan."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "When do I call?": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Quand est-ce que j'appelle ?"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Two calls a day, every day. Pick times you'll actually be awake for.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Deux appels par jour, tous les jours. Choisis des heures où tu seras vraiment réveillé."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Goals for the day": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Objectifs du jour"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "What you actually did": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ce que tu as vraiment fait"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "30 seconds for the person you'll be on day 75.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "30 secondes pour la personne que tu seras au jour 75."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Say why you're doing this. What you're tired of. What you want them to remember. Nobody hears it before day 75. Not even you.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Dis pourquoi tu fais ça. Ce dont tu en as marre. Ce que tu veux qu'il retienne. Personne ne l'entend avant le jour 75. Même pas toi."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Stick plays it back the night you finish. Nobody hears it before.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Stick le rejoue le soir où tu finis. Personne ne l'entend avant."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Seal it": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Sceller"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Day 1": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Jour 1"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "starts now.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "commence maintenant."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Your voice is ready. Now commit.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ta voix est prête. Maintenant, engage-toi."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Stick only calls paying members. No free trial: a trial is a way out, and you're done with those.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Stick n'appelle que les membres payants. Pas d'essai gratuit : un essai, c'est une porte de sortie, et tu en as fini avec ça."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Tomorrow morning": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Demain matin"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Your voice wakes you and takes your first three goals.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ta voix te réveille et prend tes trois premiers objectifs."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The first time you open TikTok": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "La première fois que tu ouvres TikTok"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "It rings. You answer to yourself.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ça sonne. Tu réponds à toi-même."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Day 75": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Jour 75"
          }
        }
      }
