    "I want this": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Je veux ça"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Day %lld · %@": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Jour %lld · %@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Every morning Stick makes you choose what replaces the scroll: %@. Every night it counts the hours you took back.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Chaque matin Stick te fait choisir ce qui remplace le scroll : %@. Chaque soir il compte les heures reprises."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The shield comes off 15 minutes a day. Stick checks every night whether you held it. Weekly trials begin.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Le bouclier se lève 15 minutes par jour. Stick vérifie chaque soir si tu as tenu. Les épreuves commencent."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "One call a day. Stick makes you write what stays after day 75. On the last night, it plays your day-1 message.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Un appel par jour. Stick te fait écrire ce qui reste après le jour 75. Le dernier soir, il rejoue ton message du jour 1."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Act I": {
      "localizations": {
